Backport of upstream Wine commit 505f126cc327 (cldapi: Add stub for CfGetPlatformInfo).

DingTalk's MainFrame.dll asks CfGetPlatformInfo whether Cloud Files are supported
after sign-in; the 11.19 stub aborted the process, the backported one answers
E_NOTIMPL, which DingTalk takes as "not supported".

diff --git a/dlls/cldapi/cldapi.spec b/dlls/cldapi/cldapi.spec
index 93e3d984b44..4cbb07b846c 100644
--- a/dlls/cldapi/cldapi.spec
+++ b/dlls/cldapi/cldapi.spec
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@
 @ stub CfGetPlaceholderStateFromAttributeTag
 @ stub CfGetPlaceholderStateFromFileInfo
 @ stub CfGetPlaceholderStateFromFindData
-@ stub CfGetPlatformInfo
+@ stdcall CfGetPlatformInfo(ptr)
 @ stub CfGetSyncRootInfoByHandle
 @ stub CfGetSyncRootInfoByPath
 @ stub CfGetTransferKey
diff --git a/dlls/cldapi/main.c b/dlls/cldapi/main.c
index f35284c94f7..751a95d9b68 100644
--- a/dlls/cldapi/main.c
+++ b/dlls/cldapi/main.c
@@ -28,3 +28,10 @@ HRESULT WINAPI CfGetPlaceholderInfo(HANDLE h, CF_PLACEHOLDER_INFO_CLASS info, vo
 
     return E_NOTIMPL;
 }
+
+HRESULT WINAPI CfGetPlatformInfo(CF_PLATFORM_INFO *info)
+{
+    FIXME("%p\n", info);
+
+    return E_NOTIMPL;
+}
diff --git a/include/cfapi.h b/include/cfapi.h
